y wants to meet you, they'll make the intro. In the meantime, if you'd like, Jack will send you excellent alternatives.\n\n\n**We never post fake jobs**\n This isn't a trick. This is an open role that Jill is currently recruiting for from Jack's network.\n   \n\n  \n\n Sometimes Jill's clients ask her to anonymize their jobs when she advertises them, which means she can't share all the details in the job description.\n   \n\n  \n\n We appreciate this can make them look a bit suspect, but there isn't much we can do about it.\n   \n\n  \n\n Give Jack a spin! You could land this role. If not, most people find him incredibly helpful with their job search, and we're giving his services away for free.","https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4428074910":"**Location** \n\n\n\n\n New Jersey (Hybrid / Onsite)\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**About the Role** \n\n\n\n\n We are seeking a AI Data Scientist to help design, develop, and deliver innovative AI, Machine Learning, Data Science, and Generative AI solutions for a leading enterprise organization.\n \n\n\n\n This role will work closely with business stakeholders, subject matter experts, AI Solution Leads, Architects, and Engineering teams to identify opportunities, develop AI solutions, and drive successful business outcomes.\n \n\n\n\n The ideal candidate combines strong technical expertise in Data Science and Generative AI with the ability to understand business problems and translate them into practical AI solutions.\n \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n**Key Responsibilities** \n\n\n\n\n**AI \\& Data Science Solution Development** \n\n\n\n* Design, develop, and deploy Machine Learning, Data Science, and Generative AI solutions.\n* Build prototypes, proof of concepts, and production\\-ready AI applications.\n* Develop predictive models, recommendation engines, classification models, and advanced analytics solutions.\n* Design and implement Large Language Model (LLM) and Retrieval\\-Augmented Generation (RAG) solutions.\n* Evaluate model perf